BT /F1 16 Tf 48 790 Td (rate-sentinel ? Business Requirements Document) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 756 Td (> **Version:** 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Status:** Draft &nbsp;|&nbsp; **Author:** Prashant Verma) Tj (&nbsp;|&nbsp; **Domain:** Platform Engineering · FinTech / Mobility) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 712 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 682 Td (Table of Contents) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 650 Td (1. [Executive Summary]\(#1-executive-summary\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 634 Td (2. [Problem Statement]\(#2-problem-statement\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 618 Td (3. [Stakeholders]\(#3-stakeholders\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 602 Td (4. [Business Objectives]\(#4-business-objectives\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 586 Td (5. [Business Rules]\(#5-business-rules\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 570 Td (6. [Functional Scope]\(#6-functional-scope\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 554 Td (7. [Performance Requirements]\(#7-performance-requirements\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 538 Td (8. [Security & Compliance Requirements]\(#8-security--compliance-requirements\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 522 Td (9. [Operational Requirements]\(#9-operational-requirements\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 506 Td (10. [Success Metrics & KPIs]\(#10-success-metrics--kpis\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 490 Td (11. [Assumptions & Constraints]\(#11-assumptions--constraints\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 474 Td (12. [Out of Scope]\(#12-out-of-scope\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 458 Td (13. [Risk Register]\(#13-risk-register\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 442 Td (14. [Glossary]\(#14-glossary\)) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 412 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 382 Td (1. Executive Summary) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 350 Td (Digital platforms operating at scale face two compounding problems: unrestricted API access) Tj (enables abuse, cost spikes, and cascading failures; and fragmented authentication and) Tj (payment logic scattered across services creates duplication, inconsistency, and security) Tj (gaps.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 278 Td (**rate-sentinel** solves this by acting as a centralised access-control, client-) Tj (verification, and payment processing gateway. It enforces who can call what and how often,) Tj (verifies client identity via multi-channel OTP, processes payments with idempotency) Tj (guarantees, and reliably dispatches notification events to a Kafka message bus for) Tj (downstream consumption.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 192 Td (This document defines the business requirements that govern what the platform must do, why) Tj (it must do it, and how success is measured ? independent of technical implementation.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 148 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 118 Td (2. Problem Statement) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 86 Td (2.1 API Abuse and Cost Exposure) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 57 Td (Without request throttling, a single misbehaving or malicious client can consume) Tj (disproportionate platform resources, degrade service quality for legitimate users, and drive) Tj (up infrastructure costs unpredictably. Existing per-service rate limiting is inconsistent,) Tj (duplicated across codebases, and not centrally manageable.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
