stream
BT /F1 12 Tf 48 776 Td (2.2 Duplicate Payment Charges) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 747 Td (In unreliable mobile and network conditions, clients retry payment requests. Without a) Tj (deduplication mechanism, retries result in double charges ? a critical trust and compliance) Tj (failure that damages customer relationships and triggers regulatory scrutiny.) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 689 Td (2.3 Fragmented Client Verification) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 660 Td (OTP generation and verification logic is implemented independently across multiple services,) Tj (leading to inconsistent security policies \(different expiry times, different lockout) Tj (thresholds, different hashing approaches\), no unified audit trail, and duplicated vendor) Tj (integrations.) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 588 Td (2.4 Decoupled Notification Dispatch) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 559 Td (Business services need to trigger customer notifications \(OTP delivery, payment) Tj (confirmation\) without owning the complexity of vendor selection, retry logic, or delivery) Tj (tracking. A clean event-driven boundary is required between "what to send" and "how to send) Tj (it.") Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 487 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 457 Td (3. Stakeholders) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 425 Td (| Stakeholder | Role | Primary Concern |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 409 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 393 Td (| Platform / DevOps Engineer | Operates the system | Live rule control, observability, no-) Tj (downtime deployments |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 363 Td (| Business / Product Owner | Owns cost and SLA | Zero double charges, bounded vendor costs,) Tj (delivery SLA |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 333 Td (| Downstream Service Teams | Produce notification events | Simple, stable Kafka contract) Tj (with no vendor ownership |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 303 Td (| Security / Compliance Officer | Audits and governs | PII handling, secrets management,) Tj (SAST scan results |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 273 Td (| End Customer | Receives OTP and payment confirmations | Fast OTP delivery, no phantom) Tj (charges |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 243 Td (| Customer Support Agent | Resolves disputes | Searchable audit trail to confirm what was) Tj (sent and when |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 199 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 169 Td (4. Business Objectives) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 137 Td (BO-1 · Protect platform revenue from API abuse) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 108 Td (Enforce configurable request limits per client and route to prevent deliberate or accidental) Tj (abuse without impacting legitimate traffic patterns.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 64 Td (**Acceptance Criteria:**) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
