BT /F1 11 Tf 48 776 Td (- JWT signing key, database passwords, and vendor API keys must be retrieved at runtime from) Tj (Azure Key Vault) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 746 Td (- Local development may use environment variables as a fallback) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 730 Td (- Any Checkmarx SAST finding flagging hardcoded secrets must block the build) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 700 Td (---) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 670 Td (BR-6 · Admin endpoints require elevated authorisation) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 641 Td (Rate limit rule management must not be accessible to ordinary client tokens.) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 611 Td (- All `/api/admin/**` endpoints require a JWT with `ROLE_ADMIN`) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 595 Td (- Client tokens \(`ROLE_CLIENT`\) must receive `403 Forbidden` on admin endpoints) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 579 Td (- Admin actions \(create, update, delete rule\) must be logged with the acting user's identity) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 549 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 519 Td (6. Functional Scope) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 487 Td (| Feature Area | In Scope | Notes |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 471 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 455 Td (| Rate limiting | Sliding Window, Token Bucket, Fixed Window | Per client, per route, live) Tj (rule updates |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 425 Td (| Authentication | JWT issue and validation | Stateless, RS256-signed |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 409 Td (| OTP | Generate, verify, lockout | SMS / Email / WhatsApp channels |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 393 Td (| Payments | Process, idempotency, status persistence | MySQL-backed, gateway-agnostic |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 377 Td (| Notification dispatch | Kafka publish to 4 topics | Channel-based routing |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 361 Td (| Admin rule API | CRUD with live cache eviction | ADMIN role required |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 345 Td (| Observability | Prometheus metrics, structured logs | Grafana dashboards in message-relay) Tj (|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 301 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 271 Td (7. Performance Requirements) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 239 Td (| Requirement | Target | Measurement Method |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 223 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 207 Td (| Rate limit decision latency | p99 < 5ms | JMeter load test, 10,000 req/sec |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 191 Td (| OTP verification latency | p99 < 10ms | JMeter, 3,000 req/sec sustained |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 175 Td (| Payment processing latency | p99 < 45ms | JMeter, 1,500 req/sec sustained |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 159 Td (| Kafka publish throughput | > 5,000 events/sec | JMeter + Kafka consumer lag monitoring |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 143 Td (| Horizontal scalability | Linear to 5 instances | No state in JVM; all state externalised |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 113 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 83 Td (8. Security & Compliance Requirements) Tj /F1 12 Tf 48 51 Td (SC-1 · SAST scanning on every pull request) Tj ET
endstream
