BT /F1 13 Tf 48 776 Td (10. Success Metrics & KPIs) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 744 Td (| KPI | Target | Baseline \(pre-platform\) |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 728 Td (|---|---|---|) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 712 Td (| Duplicate payment incidents | 0 | Unknown \(untracked\) |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 696 Td (| Rate limit decision latency \(p99\) | < 5ms | N/A \(no prior rate limiter\) |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 680 Td (| OTP verification latency \(p99\) | < 10ms | ~50ms \(per-service impl\) |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 664 Td (| Code duplication across services | ?60% | Fragmented per-service |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 648 Td (| Time to add new notification channel | < 1 sprint | 2?3 sprints |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 632 Td (| Security vulnerabilities \(Checkmarx\) | 0 critical/high | Unknown |) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 602 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 572 Td (11. Assumptions & Constraints) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 540 Td (**Assumptions:**) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 524 Td (- Downstream services are capable of generating stable UUID idempotency keys per payment) Tj (intent) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 494 Td (- A Kafka cluster \(single-broker acceptable in dev/test\) is available in all environments) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 478 Td (- Azure Key Vault access is provisioned for production deployments) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 462 Td (- Mock vendor implementations are acceptable for initial delivery; real SDK integration is a) Tj (subsequent iteration) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 418 Td (**Constraints:**) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 402 Td (- Java 17 and Spring Boot 3.x are the mandated runtime stack) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 386 Td (- All infrastructure must be containerisable for AKS deployment) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 370 Td (- SonarCloud free tier is used ? public repository required for unlimited scans) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 354 Td (- Checkmarx One free tier limits scans to 10 per month) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 324 Td (---) Tj /F1 13 Tf 48 294 Td (12. Out of Scope) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 262 Td (The following are explicitly not part of rate-sentinel v1.0:) Tj /F1 11 Tf 48 232 Td (- Webhook callbacks to notify callers of asynchronous payment status changes) 